🌍 Overview
Most connectivity tools only tell you the signal quality right where you're standing. NetCompass goes further.
It measures, analyzes, and compares cellular performance in every direction around you, then tells you exactly where to go for a better connection.
```
MEASURE → ANALYZE → COMPARE → RECOMMEND → RECORD → MAP → LEARN
```
NetCompass is not tied to a single city. It's a general-purpose platform that adapts to any searchable location — cities, hill stations, coastal towns, rural belts, or remote tourist destinations.
---
✨ Core Innovation — Directional Cellular Intelligence
Instead of a single connectivity score, NetCompass scans 8 directions around the user and highlights the strongest one.
Direction	Score
North	62
North-East	74
East	93 ⭐
South-East	81
South	65
South-West	49
West	57
North-West	71
> 🧭 **Recommended:** *"Move toward the East for improved cellular connectivity."*
---
📍 Dynamic, Location-Aware by Design
NetCompass detects the user's current location (with permission) and lets them independently explore any destination before traveling there — without changing their real-world location context.
Concept	Meaning
Current Location	Where the user physically is right now
Explore Destination	A place the user wants to research before visiting
Example: Current Location: Coimbatore → Explore Destination: Ooty
If location access is denied, the app gracefully falls back to manual search — it never breaks.
A single global location state drives every screen in the app (dashboard, scanner, heatmap, analytics, history, tourism assistant), so nothing stays hard-coded to one place.
