🧩 Key Features
📊 Current Connectivity Dashboard — Live score, network type, signal strength, speed, latency, packet loss, and best direction at a glance
🧭 360° Connectivity Scanner — Interactive compass scan across 8 directions with an animated sweep and a clear recommendation
🗺️ Cellular Connectivity Heatmap — Interactive map with color-coded coverage points, filterable by network, metric, time range, and layer
⚠️ Connectivity Gap Detection — Flags consistently weak zones and recommends how far/which direction to move
🧳 Tourist Connectivity Assistant — One-tap "Find Better Connectivity" with an animated directional guide
📈 Reliability Score — Transparent, weighted scoring model (signal, speed, latency, packet loss, stability)
🕒 Connectivity History — Time-series charts across multiple locations, filterable by date range
🔬 Network Performance Analytics — Aggregate stats and trend charts across all tracked locations
⚖️ Location Comparison — Side-by-side connectivity comparison across tourist destinations
🌐 Community Connectivity Network (planned) — Crowdsourced measurement pipeline feeding a shared heatmap
🔌 Hardware Integration (planned) — ESP32 + cellular modem measurement unit for real-world data collection
📴 Offline Mode (planned) — Local measurement caching with automatic sync on reconnect
🤖 Future AI (planned) — Coverage prediction, anomaly detection, and intelligent tourism routing
