⚠️ Prototype Disclaimer
NetCompass is currently a software prototype using sample/demo data. Values shown are illustrative and location-specific datasets are used to demonstrate how the system adapts across places. The architecture is designed so sample data can later be replaced by live measurements from real hardware, with no structural changes needed.
All AI-related features (coverage prediction, anomaly detection, smart routing) are labeled Future Development and are not currently implemented.
---
🔒 Privacy
Location access is requested explicitly and only used to personalize the experience
If denied, users can manually search/select a destination
Precise GPS coordinates are not unnecessarily stored — approximate city/area data is used where possible
